WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.584
Summer vacation starts tomorrow.

2
00:00:07.585 --> 00:00:13.089
My family has so many plans!

3
00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:18.557
We'll visit an amusement park.

4
00:00:18.558 --> 00:00:26.382
I'm going to ride a roller coaster. Whee!

5
00:00:26.383 --> 00:00:30.489
We'll visit a forest.

6
00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:36.879
I'm going to catch fish in the lake.

7
00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:42.200
We'll visit an island.

8
00:00:42.201 --> 00:00:46.693
I'm going to swim in the ocean.

9
00:00:46.694 --> 00:00:52.190
We'll visit a big city.

10
00:00:52.191 --> 00:00:57.657
I'm going to see a science museum.

11
00:00:57.658 --> 00:01:02.733
We'll visit an aquarium.

12
00:01:02.734 --> 00:01:08.807
I'm going to meet dolphins.

13
00:01:08.808 --> 00:01:12.876
We'll visit a water park.

14
00:01:12.877 --> 00:01:20.275
I'm going to ride a waterslide.

15
00:01:20.276 --> 00:01:24.100
I'm so excited!

16
00:01:24.101 --> 00:01:32.282
What will you do this summer?

